<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>From the mountains to the seas:</l><l>Flowers and bugs, rocks and grass, leaves and trees.</l><l>God’s design, we can see:</l><l>In things great and small He created for me!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
